---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const schema = {
	"@context": "https://schema.org",
	"@type": "ProfilePage",
	"mainEntity": {
		"@type": "Person",
		"name": "Jack Flewett",
		"jobTitle": "Marketing Engineer",
		"worksFor": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Tatkraft Marketing" },
		"sameAs": ["https://www.linkedin.com/in/jack-flewett-58b8964/"]
	}
};
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Jack Flewett — 20+ years in senior digital growth leadership across global SaaS and AI-native businesses. Now building Tatkraft Marketing."
	schema={schema}
>
	<h1>About</h1>
	<p class="tagline">Jack Flewett, Marketing Engineer.</p>

	<p>
		Twenty years in digital and growth marketing across global SaaS and AI-native
		businesses, at senior and executive level — owning digital acquisition and
		growth strategy across multiple international markets.
	</p>

	<p>
		My experience and track record allow me to consult on strategic growth
		marketing — I've managed multi-million dollar annual budgets and scaled teams
		from a handful of specialists to dozens, delivering sustained double-digit lead
		growth over years rather than quarters. But I'm just as comfortable rolling up
		my sleeves with smaller clients and leaner budgets. I've kept my hands on the
		tools throughout, not just the strategy, and stayed current with what's
		genuinely cutting edge — most recently building AI-enabled content systems that
		materially increased qualified leads and search visibility within months, not
		years.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'm especially passionate about supporting New Zealand businesses — helping
		local companies grow and compete using the same calibre of thinking usually
		reserved for much bigger budgets.
	</p>

	<h2>Marketing Engineer</h2>
	<p>
		An emerging title describing a full-stack marketer with the skills of a builder —
		someone who works at the system level to automate at the campaign level, rather
		than executing channel-by-channel. That's the position Tatkraft Marketing
		operates from: growth outcomes, built with AI-native systems.
	</p>

	<h2>Backed by a trusted network</h2>
	<p>
		Behind every engagement sits a hand-picked network of specialist freelancers —
		people I've worked alongside for years, in areas like technical SEO and data
		integration, brought in exactly when a project needs that extra depth. You get
		senior strategic ownership from me, backed by specialist firepower on tap —
		without ever paying for a bloated team.
	</p>

	<a class="cta" href="/contact">Get in touch</a>

	<p>
		Full career history available on&nbsp;
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jack-flewett-58b8964/">LinkedIn</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
